Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:20.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Masshiro hikari no naka me o samashite\Nhajimatteiku sutoorii
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:26.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Fumidasu atarashii sekai donna hana o sakaseyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:34.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Kumori sora datte mizutamari de yogoretatte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura wa susumu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:44.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Souzou mo shinai mirai ga matteiru kitto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:47.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Deatte deatte tsunagatteku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Waraeba mawari mo egao ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Chiisana tane maite sodateyou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:59.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Yagate ookina hana ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Koukai ya shippai wa kate ni shite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Karafuru na shiawase de afureru youni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:10.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Bokura te o toriatte wakeatte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:16.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu ni hirogatteike Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spring passed us by, and the sun began\Nshining down stronger each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:40.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vegetables all look\Nso much brighter and more colorful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,after they've been sunbathing for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:47.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's break time. Let's have lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get everything ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.75,0:01:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This one might grow too tall like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm much more knowledgeable about\Nthis stuff than when I first started farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see about the other plants...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's break time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to take breaks too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I look out at the crops,\NI just can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic really is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've told you; this is basic stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel revitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you work too hard,\Nyou could collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, is it okay for you\Nto be walking around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've heard it's good to\Nget some exercise now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:04.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been teaching me\Nall kinds of stuff.\N{\rSubtitle}Obviously, you can't push yourself too hard,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}but I heard from the girls in the village{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you can't push yourself too hard,\Nbut I heard from the girls in the village
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Reproduction and prosperity!\N{\rSubtitle}that it's important to exercise{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}to keep your body strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that it's important to exercise\Nto keep your body strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:14.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found out that a few of the ogre maid girls\Nhave actually given birth themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't really know\Nanything about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It strange to think that she\Nhas a child inside her belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.71,0:03:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that must feel like for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what it's actually feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you've gotten so big,\Nit's got to feel heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's about the same\Nas two heads of cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you must feel pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How lovely. I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll be a boy.\NOr maybe a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there any way to know that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we do anything to\Nmake you more comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please let us know if there's\Nanything we can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone's being so kind and\Nhelpful that I'm fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My appetite is back now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only thing bothering me is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I can't drink any alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forgive our insolence,\Nbut we've come to make a request today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're here to ask that Tia and\Neveryone else's resolution not go to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've all become so dejected\Nthat we can't bear to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We implore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please sell off all the alcohol in the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. You're all giving up alcohol for Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we think about\Nnot being able to drink, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whenever we're eating and we think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Man, some alcohol would\Ngo great with this!" it feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this point I believe the only option is\Nto remove the source of their suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:04:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy that you're all doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I think you'll end up regretting it\Nif we sell all the alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, alcohol isn't something\Nwe can quickly make again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The taste of alcohol changes\Nthe longer you let it age after making it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that if you can hold out for now,\Nit'll taste even better later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's all tough it out\Nwhile looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor, can you tell us\Nif we've done something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though everyone used to\Nlove drinking alcohol,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,none of them will drink\Na single drop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? So that's all it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So it's not like they stopped\Nenjoying the alcohol we produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. We should have\Nlet you know right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that we should\Nslow down production right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now I think we should do the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm sure everyone will\Ndrink more to make up for lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great! We'll do our best to live up to\Neveryone's expectations!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not in here because\NI'm not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sun is really strong today\Nso I'm staying inside just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's almost time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I get any bigger than this,\NI really won't be able to move at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tia and the angels came to visit me\Nand brought it with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They said they found it blooming on a\Nfar away mountain where there was still snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It kind of makes the room feel cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, that flower\Nis actually releasing cold air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a secret mountain elf medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that's said to bring about\Ngood health and vigor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:57.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is really valuable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd rather it be used\Nwhen the time is right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,than have it sit around\Nin storage forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like she's talking about\Na rare item from a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi, Lu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a gem that's supposed to help\Nwith magic recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found it in my father's treasure room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After much hard work and toiling,\Nit's finally complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a good luck charm wreath!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to peel apples for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must be very hungry now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made tomato and tofu miso soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tomato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all born from eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I have absolutely no idea\Nwhat I can do now to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But at the very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can offer you my blood to drink\Nso that you'll grow stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think my teeth can\Nmake it through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A wooden mallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's from Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He said to trust him that it would\Ncome in handy later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come in handy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you need a wooden mallet for childbirth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My belly feels kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bring the towels here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boil more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When the time came, I found myself\Nin a panic for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now there's nothing left\Nthat I can do to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On my first night here, I watched them\Nfrom this very same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back then I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to live somewhere by myself,\Naway from anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now, I have everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm sure that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, time passed by\Nlike a blur until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more accurate to say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:07.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I don't have any memories of\Nwhat happened after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything went great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.13,0:10:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're both doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was just born. Watch his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure to support it with your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And he's heavier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though he's so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was moving around a lot\Nwhen he was still in my belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He smiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was a smile, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's happy that his dad's holding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've really become a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back in my original world,\NI was suffering from an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope he never has to go through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grow up to be strong for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's not going to just grow up strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we're going to raise him to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.63,0:11:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:07.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a week since Lu gave birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My son's name is Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was Lu's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess his race is technically\Nhalf-vampire... maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But right now he looks like\Na normal human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is where I started living by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A lot more people live here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are more buildings now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything kept growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now it's a village where I live\Ntogether with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I became mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, I've finally become a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to do something to thank\Nall the villagers for their kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've all been working so hard\Nup until now to help build up the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What did you gather us\Nto talk about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I've been thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a new system I want to\Nset up for this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A system?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a reward medal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A medal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to give these medals out\Nto everyone who helped
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,build up the village as thanks\Nfor their hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do we use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can trade them for goods you want
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or use them to get\Nother things you're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then they're like money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured that one day The Great Tree Village\Nwould need its own currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now we have\Na lot of stuff in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Crops, hunted game meat, and traded goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the mayor of the village, I've been\Ntaking charge of all these things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then distributing them\Nto everyone myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whenever someone wants something,\Nthey come ask me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But with the increasing\Npopulation of the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,handling all of these transactions on my own\Nhas become borderline impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we're going to handle transactions\Non our own, then we need currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't we just trade goods with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think about it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many strawberries is\Na single apple worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, I'd say about three strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd say they're one to one\Nsince I prefer strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup. Everyone places\Na different value for things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to use currency\Nfor our transactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's what money is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many barrels of gold\Nis an apple worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I almost never use money so I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You count it in barrels?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I expect nothing less from the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I think it would\Ncause a lot of turmoil
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if I switched everything over\Nto currency right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So for now I'm going to start by\Ngiving these out as reward medals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:15:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. In that case,\Nlet's try them out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For now, let's just think of these as
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,convenient little vouchers\Nyou exchange for things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so to get things going, I started by\Ngiving all the villagers three medals each.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't give out medals to\Nall of Kuro and Zabuton's families,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I gave them 30 medals each.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On top of that, I have to make them all by hand\Nin a way that they can't be counterfeited.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That limits how many I can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone reacted differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some people traded them\Nfor wine right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some people traded them\Nfor furniture and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some people traded them for weapons\Nthat Dryme had brought us as gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And some people...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just decorated their rooms with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer it if they didn't just\Nhold onto them without spending any.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how I started\Nintroducing the reward medals
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that were the precursors for currency, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh! I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...it resulted in orders for\Ncustom made furniture and toys
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to become incredibly popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, I feel like\NI'm doing more work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:05.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, just wait a little while for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In addition, I said that I wanted to use these\Nas a guide for how much things are worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But sometimes it's hard to determine exactly\Nhow much a single medal should be worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to give me... a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that an option?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if I give you three?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end, we settled on them\Nrenting out the mayor for a day instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And a little while after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...it was finally time for the big feast\Nto celebrate the birth of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I kind of feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I kept them all waiting for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we couldn't have a feast\Nright after you gave birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, they all seem to be enjoying\Nthemselves now, so I think it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am a little worried that they\Nmight drink too much, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hi there! It's your big sister, Flora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Donovan told me to\Nbring it here with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry we took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a special new kind of wine\Nthat we made just for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is our way of celebrating with you,\Nso make sure you do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time to use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's what it's for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That felt really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be cracking open\Na barrel of wine in celebration in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess doing something big like this always\Nmakes celebrations more fun, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone, drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, this booze is great!\NThe food is great! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for my secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think of the wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Donovan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I've been told I shouldn't\Ndrink as long as I'm breastfeeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see. You can't drink\Nas long as he's still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'll let them all drink for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll enjoy the wine by watching\Nall their smiling faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about before everyone drinks it all,\Nwe bottle it so we can age the wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can hold onto it until Alfred\Nis old enough to drink it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to keep it safe\Nand age it so it's the best wine ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get started on this right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we drag our feet, they'll drink it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I want more!\N{\rSubtitle}If we drag our feet, they'll drink it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The day I can drink wine\Nwith my son. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That day will be here before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,as long as you're enjoying life\Nevery day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alfred loves his big sister Flora so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think he wants to be my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.04,0:19:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About The Great Tree Village...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They had a child.\NIt was a healthy baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Based on all of the information\Nwe've heard so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think the very notion that we could\Nchallenge them is impossible as of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.33,0:19:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you've finally realized it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should be thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how we can maintain an amicable\Nrelationship with that village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we can marry off someone from the\NDemonic Kingdom to their village one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then it will guarantee our safety here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.63,0:20:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't hand over Yuri as a bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to anyone ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you gather all the goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll leave a poor impression if we don't\Nmake sure to congratulate them properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We must make sure\Nall our preparations are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want our relationship with that village\Nto continue on for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just had a dream\Nfor the first time in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that you have a hangover?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you didn't drink last night, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I want to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:13.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,something that Granmaria and the others\Nbrought up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People that want to move here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were living in a different forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and now they're looking for\Nsomewhere new to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dryme said that he's got some people that were\Ndriven out of their homes because of a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My father also mentioned that\Nthere are some refugees
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that need a place to stay because of\Nthe war with Fullhardt Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not an exact figure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.21,0:21:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I'm giving a rough estimate, it's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We broke the three-digit mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we'd need another village like this one\Nif we're going to take that many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's build a new village for the people\Nthat want to move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:48.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we do that, then lots of people\Ncan move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So it'll be The Great Tree Village 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, won't that be a ton of work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to prepare and gather supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This village saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If someone needs our help,\Nwe can't just leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:10.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, we'll need to plan everything out\Nvery carefully for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where should we build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright. Let's have a meeting\Nabout it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on your help, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:43.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Kisetsu no kaze fuwari yubisaki de sotto kanjiru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:52.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Sora ni ukabu kumo ni daisuki sagasou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:57.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Tokei no hari wa ima wa wasure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:23:02.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Shinkokyuu hitotsu shitemiyouyo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:11.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Nanairo no keshiki kokoro hibiku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:18.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Donna negai koto demo kanau ki ga suru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:22.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Kimi ga soba ni iru nara
